  "ruleText": "Pes 202.20 Close of Record. After the conclusion of the hearing, no other evidence, shall be allowed into the record.\n\nSource. #5590, eff 2-25-93; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8058, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-A, eff 10-3-12",
